WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Rent is up.

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.350
Food is up.

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.750
Transport too.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.260
It's exhausting.

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:09.650
International remote roles open the door to foreign-currency earnings.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:12.380
That can mean more spending power in naira.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:16.750
OpenRemote Match helps you find relevant roles open to Nigeria.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.550
With practical help to apply.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:21.000
See how it works.

